2:T663,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does a bathroom renovation take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The timescale depends on the room's size, the amount of strip-out, the layout, product availability and any hidden repairs. A straightforward replacement is usually quicker than a full renovation involving moved plumbing or extensive preparation, so ask for a project-specific programme."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does bathroom fitting cost in the UK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Every project differs according to the fittings, tiles, labour, room condition and whether the layout changes. For accurate pricing, request a free, no-obligation quote from BMB Renovation and check whether preparation, waste removal and finishing are included."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do bathroom fitters move plumbing and electrics?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Many bathroom fitting teams can coordinate plumbing and electrical work, but the exact scope should be confirmed in writing. Moving services may affect the work programme, particularly where floors or walls need to be opened and repaired."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I ask bathroom fitters before hiring them?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ask what is included in the quotation, how unexpected defects are handled, who carries out each part of the work, how long the project is expected to take and what preparation you need to complete. It is also sensible to ask how the room will be protected and how waste will be removed."}}]}7:["slug","bathroom-fitters-before-and-after","d"]
9:T4d5,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HomeAndConstructionBusiness","name":"BMB Renovation","url":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk","logo":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/favicon.svg","image":"https://bmbrenovation.co.uk/og-image.png","description":"BMB Renovation offers premium home, kitchen & bathroom renovation services in Watford, London & Hertfordshire. 15+ years of experience. Free consultation.","telephone":"+447775758717","email":"contact@bmbrenovation.co.uk","priceRange":"££","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"157 Judge Street","addressLocality":"Watford","postalCode":"WD24 5AN","addressRegion":"Hertfordshire","addressCountry":"GB"},"geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":51.6549,"longitude":-0.3978},"areaServed":["Watford","Bushey","Rickmansworth","St Albans","Hemel Hempstead","Borehamwood","Harrow","Croxley Green","Luton","Bedford","London"],"openingHoursSpecification":[{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"],"opens":"08:00","closes":"18:00"},{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":"Saturday","opens":"09:00","closes":"16:00"}],"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/bmbrenovation","https://www.instagram.com/bmbrenovation"]}0:["Yknwy9EI8g0SB-iSiJ_A9",[[["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","bathroom-fitters-before-and-after","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"bathroom-fitters-before-and-after\"}",{}]}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","bathroom-fitters-before-and-after","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen flex flex-col","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Bathroom Fitters Before and After: What to Expect\",\"description\":\"See what bathroom fitters do before and after a renovation, from stripping out and plumbing to tiling, finis